  "about": "Spec 102 R7 + R8: where each signature and key ceremony goes, per account record, JSON-RPC method and surface. 'standard' is the apps, the web wallet and the Chrome extension; 'safari_extension' is the Safari Web Extension, whose pages cannot use a getvela.app passkey (WebKit: SecurityError, RPID) - there nothing is signed in Vela. route null: a method no venue signs. ceremony_page: R3 on a surface (the machines' page for create, add a key, sign in, a proof), null = in the app. Read by vela-core (tests/signing_route_surface.rs) and by the web through the wasm (signingRoute).",
